# Public repo: media, model weights and secrets never enter git (AGENTS.md).
# Keep generated files in a job directory outside the repo.

# Video
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
# Audio
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.aac
